        "description": "Classifies a raster dataset based on an Esri classifier definition file (.ecd) and raster dataset inputs.",
        "in_additional_raster.descr": "Ancillary raster datasets, such as a multispectral image or a DEM, will be incorporated to generate attributes and other required information for the classifier. This raster is necessary when calculating attributes such as mean or standard deviation. This parameter is optional.",
